title: "Historical Timeline: Deliverable 1, How Each Simple Fix Led to the Next"
---
flowchart TD
    A["Idea 1:<br/>No memory at all"] -->|"People had to repeat<br/>themselves every time"| B["Idea 2:<br/>Send the whole chat<br/>back every time"]
    B -->|"Got too slow and<br/>too expensive;<br/>hit a hard text limit"| C["Idea 3:<br/>Summarize the<br/>old parts"]
    C -->|"Summaries quietly<br/>dropped details"| D["Idea 4:<br/>Keep only the last<br/>few messages"]
    D -->|"Important old facts<br/>got deleted just<br/>because they were old"| E["Idea 5:<br/>Separate notes file<br/>of important facts"]
    E -->|"No clear rule for<br/>'important'; file grew<br/>huge and slow again"| F["Idea 6:<br/>Search for facts<br/>that sound related"]
    F -->|"Could not tell an old<br/>fact from the new one<br/>that replaced it"| G["A real memory system<br/>is needed:<br/>knows what's current,<br/>can fix/delete facts,<br/>keeps people separate"]
